DESC Disables Forwarding type of snoops when set for RXSNP
F 2 1 stashing_snp_dis
DESC Disables Stashing type of snoops when set for RXSNP
F 3 10 snp_opcode_dis
DESC Disables support for RXSNP different snoop opcodes and changes to similar snoop opcode when set [3]:  Change SNPSTASHSHARED to SNPQUERY [4]:  Change SNPSTASHUNIQUE to SNPQUERY [5]:  Change SNPMAKEINVALIDSTASH to SNPMAKEINVALID [6]:  Change SNPCLEANSHARED to SNPCLEANINVALID [7]:  Change SNPPREFERUNIQUE(FWD) to SNPUNIQUE [8]:  Change SNPNOTSHAREDDIRTY(FWD) to SNPUNIQUE [9]:  Change SNPCLEAN(FWD) to SNPUNIQUE [10]: Change SNPUNIQUESTASH to SNPUNIQUE [11]: Change SNPONCE(FWD) to SNPUNIQUE [12]: Change SNPSHARED(FWD) to SNPUNIQUE 
F 20 10 req_op_downgrade
DESC Downgrades req opcode when set [20]:  Change READSHARED to READUNIQ [21]:  Change READNOTSHAREDDIRTY to READUNIQ [22]:  Change READPREFERUNIQ to READUNIQ [23]:  Change READONCEMKINV to READONCE [24]:  Change READONCECLNINV to READONCE [25]:  Change MAKEUNIQ to CLNUNIQ [26]:  Change MAKEREADUNIQ to READUNIQ [27]:  Change WRITEEVICTOREVICT to EVICT [28]:  Change MAKEINVALID to CLEANINVALID [29]:  Change WRITEUNIQUEFULL to non-allocating WRITEUNIQUEPTL 
F 32 1 lbt_atomic_fwd_dis
