DESC Disables LCC lookup for a SF victim.
F 51 1 lcc_clean_victim_dis
DESC Disables LCC sending clean eviction to Home Node.
F 52 1 slc_way_reserve_dis
DESC Disables SLC reserved way for HBT lines in HNS mode and allow LBT lines to take all ways in system cache.
F 54 1 cs_lcc_drop_en
DESC Enables LCC to drop clean copy after writing dirty data for CleanShared.
F 57 1 send_compack_aft_alldat
DESC Enables sending CompAck after all data beats are received
F 58 1 pm_flush_brdcast_snp
DESC Enables broadcast snoop to all local RNFs when PM flushes LBT SF entry. Can program to 1'b0 only when it's guaranteed that no coherence traffic comes to HNS during PM flush.
F 59 1 ha_snp_throttle_dis
DESC Disable CCG HA snoop throttling when enabling multiple snoop VCs.
PAR HNS_3XTXSNP_EN_PARAM
