RESET 0x40000 0x7f9fe7f803f02b1
DESC Contols the responses sent from HNS to RNF. CONSTRAINT: The hns_adv_cbusy_mode_en must be 1'b1 to use this feature.
RGO cmn_hns_rcr.sam_control
SGO cmn_hns_scr.sam_control
F 0 1 sn_cbusy_prop_en
DESC Controls HN-F and SN-F cbusy on responses to RN-F 1'b0: HN-F's POCQ Cbusy is sent 1'b1: SN-F's Cbusy is sent
F 4 1 cbusy_highest_of_all_en
DESC Controls cbusy between HN-F and SN-F 1'b0: Will send the HN-F or SN-F as configured 1'b1: Will select highest CBusy value between the SN-F and HN-F
F 5 1 cbusy_sn_req_throttle_dis
DESC Disables Cbusy based request throttling from HNS to SNF when set to 1'b1
F 7 1 cbusy_sn_static_ot_mode_en
DESC Controls cbusy between HN-F and SN-F 1'b0: HN-F will dynamically throttle outstanding requests to SN-F 1'b1: HN-F will use fixed transactions count at each CBusy level at 1/4th POCQ granularity CONSTRAINT: For SN request throttling, CBusy aggregation is always based on SN_CBusy[1:0] and cbusy_alt_mode_en is inapplicable
F 9 1 cbusy_sn_retried_req_throttle_en
DESC Enables throttling retried requests with static grants (from SN) along with dynamic credit requests
F 16 6 cbusy_sn_dynamic_ot_count
DESC Specifies the granularity at which HN-F will dynamically throttle transactions to SN-F. CONSTRAINT: 1,2,4,8 are the the allowed values
F 31 8 cbusy_sn_static_ot_count_cbusy11
DESC Specifies the maximum number of transactions to SN-F when SN Cbusy=11 in static throttling mode. CONSTRAINT: Value must be less than HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM-1 and less than cbusy_sn_static_ot_count_cbusy10
PAR (HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM / 4)
F 41 8 cbusy_sn_static_ot_count_cbusy10
DESC Specifies the maximum number of transactions to SN-F when SN Cbusy=10 in static throttling mode. CONSTRAINT: Value must be less than HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM-1 and less than cbusy_sn_static_ot_count_cbusy01
PAR (HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM / 2)
F 51 8 cbusy_sn_static_ot_count_cbusy01
DESC Specifies the maximum number of transactions to SN-F when SN Cbusy=01 in static throttling mode. CONSTRAINT: Value must be less than HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM-1
PAR (HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM * 3 / 4)
R 0x1010 64 - ROOT cmn_hns_cbusy_sn_ctl
RESET 0x100001000200040 0x3ff03ff03ff03ff
