R 0x1018 64 - ROOT cmn_hns_lbt_cbusy_ctl
RESET 0x40000 0x7f9fe7f803f0297
DESC Controls the CBusy response for LCN Bound Transactions. CONSTRAINT: The hns_adv_cbusy_mode_en must be 1'b1 to use this feature.
RGO cmn_hns_rcr.sam_control
SGO cmn_hns_scr.sam_control
F 0 2 cbusy_lbt_mode_cnt
DESC Controls the propagation of Cbusy field for LCN bound transactions. 2'b00: Send HNS POCQ Cbusy on all responses based on the limits programmed in cmn_hns_cbusy_limit_ctl 2'b01: Pass through HNF CBusy on late completion responses (CompData, Comp) 2'b10: Greater of POCQ Cbusy or HNF Cbusy. Applicable to responses where remote Cbusy can be sent
F 2 1 cbusy_lbt_req_throttle_dis
DESC Disables Cbusy based request throttling from HNS to LBT when set to 1'b1
F 4 1 cbusy_lbt_retried_req_throttle_en
DESC Enables throttling retried requests with static grants (from LBT) along with dynamic credit requests
F 7 1 cbusy_hnf_static_ot_mode_en
DESC Controls cbusy between HN-F and HN-F 1'b0: HN-F will dynamically throttle outstanding requests to HN-F 1'b1: HN-F will use fixed transactions count at each CBusy level at 1/4th POCQ granularity CONSTRAINT: For SN request throttling, CBusy aggregation is always based on SN_CBusy[1:0] and cbusy_alt_mode_en is inapplicable
F 9 1 cbusy_hnf_retried_req_throttle_en
DESC Enables throttling retried requests with static grants (from HN-F) along with dynamic credit requests
F 16 6 cbusy_hnf_dynamic_ot_count
DESC Specifies the granularity at which HN-F will dynamically throttle transactions to HN-F. CONSTRAINT: 1,2,4,8 are the the allowed values
F 31 8 cbusy_hnf_static_ot_count_cbusy11
DESC Specifies the maximum number of transactions to HN-F when HN Cbusy=11 in static throttling mode. CONSTRAINT: Value must be less than HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM-1 and less than cbusy_sn_static_ot_count_cbusy10
PAR (HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM / 4)
F 41 8 cbusy_hnf_static_ot_count_cbusy10
DESC Specifies the maximum number of transactions to HN-F when HN Cbusy=10 in static throttling mode. CONSTRAINT: Value must be less than HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM-1 and less than cbusy_sn_static_ot_count_cbusy01
PAR (HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM / 2)
F 51 8 cbusy_hnf_static_ot_count_cbusy01
DESC Specifies the maximum number of transactions to HN-F when HN Cbusy=01 in static throttling mode. CONSTRAINT: Value must be less than HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM-1
PAR (HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM * 3 / 4)
