R 0x1078 64 - ROOT cmn_hns_cbusy_hnf_threshold
RESET 0x100001000200040 0x3ff03ff03ff03ff
DESC Controls the HN-F cbusy thresholds. CONSTRAINT: The hns_adv_cbusy_mode_en must be 1'b1 to use this feature.
RGO cmn_hns_rcr.sam_control
SGO cmn_hns_scr.sam_control
F 0 10 cbusy_hnf_threshold_cntr01
DESC CBusy threshold at which HN-F is considered busy for Counter_01
F 16 10 cbusy_hnf_threshold_cntr10
DESC CBusy threshold at which HN-F is considered busy for Counter_10
F 32 10 cbusy_hnf_threshold_cntr11
DESC CBusy threshold at which HN-F is considered busy for Counter_11
F 48 10 cbusy_hnf_txn_cnt
DESC Number of HN-F transactions over which the counters are tracked
R 0x1080 64 - ROOT cmn_hns_cbusy_ccg_ctl
RESET 0x40000 0x7f9fe7f803f0280
DESC Controls the CBusy response for LCN Bound Transactions to CCG. CONSTRAINT: The hns_adv_cbusy_mode_en must be 1'b1 to use this feature.
RGO cmn_hns_rcr.sam_control
SGO cmn_hns_scr.sam_control
F 7 1 cbusy_ccg_static_ot_mode_en
DESC Controls cbusy between HN-F and CCG 1'b0: HN-F will dynamically throttle outstanding requests to HN-F 1'b1: HN-F will use fixed transactions count at each CBusy level at 1/4th POCQ granularity CONSTRAINT: For SN request throttling, CBusy aggregation is always based on SN_CBusy[1:0] and cbusy_alt_mode_en is inapplicable
F 9 1 cbusy_ccg_retried_req_throttle_en
DESC Enables throttling retried requests with static grants (from CCG) along with dynamic credit requests
F 16 6 cbusy_ccg_dynamic_ot_count
DESC Specifies the granularity at which HN-F will dynamically throttle transactions to CCG. CONSTRAINT: 1,2,4,8 are the the allowed values
F 31 8 cbusy_ccg_static_ot_count_cbusy11
DESC Specifies the maximum number of transactions to CCG when HN Cbusy=11 in static throttling mode. CONSTRAINT: Value must be less than HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM-1 and less than cbusy_sn_static_ot_count_cbusy10
PAR (HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM / 4)
F 41 8 cbusy_ccg_static_ot_count_cbusy10
DESC Specifies the maximum number of transactions to CCG when HN Cbusy=10 in static throttling mode. CONSTRAINT: Value must be less than HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM-1 and less than cbusy_sn_static_ot_count_cbusy01
PAR (HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM / 2)
F 51 8 cbusy_ccg_static_ot_count_cbusy01
DESC Specifies the maximum number of transactions to CCG when HN Cbusy=01 in static throttling mode. CONSTRAINT: Value must be less than HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM-1
PAR (HNS_NUM_ENTRIES_POCQ_PARAM * 3 / 4)
R 0x1088 64 - ROOT cmn_hns_cbusy_ccg_threshold
RESET 0x100001000200040 0x3ff03ff03ff03ff
DESC Controls the CCG cbusy thresholds. CONSTRAINT: The hns_adv_cbusy_mode_en must be 1'b1 to use this feature.
RGO cmn_hns_rcr.sam_control
SGO cmn_hns_scr.sam_control
F 0 10 cbusy_ccg_threshold_cntr01
DESC CBusy threshold at which HN-F is considered busy for Counter_01
F 16 10 cbusy_ccg_threshold_cntr10
DESC CBusy threshold at which HN-F is considered busy for Counter_10
F 32 10 cbusy_ccg_threshold_cntr11
DESC CBusy threshold at which HN-F is considered busy for Counter_11
F 48 10 cbusy_ccg_txn_cnt
DESC Number of HN-F transactions over which the counters are tracked
