F 24 1 htg0_inv_top_address_bit
DESC Inverts the top address bit (top_address_bit1 if 3-SN, top_address_bit2 if 6-SN); only used when the address map does not have unique address bit combinations
F 25 4 htg0_sn_mode
DESC SN selection mode 4'b0000: Reserved 4'b0001: 3-SN mode (SN0, SN1, SN2) 4'b0010: 6-SN mode (SN0, SN1, SN2, SN3, SN4, SN5) 4'b0011: 5-SN mode (SN0, SN1, SN2, SN3, SN4) 4'b0100: 2-SN mode (SN0, SN1) power of 2 hashing 4'b0101: 4-SN mode (SN0, SN1, SN2, SN3) power of 2 hashing 4'b0110: 8-SN mode (SN0, SN1, SN2, SN3, SN4, SN5, SN6, SN7) power of 2 hashing 4'b0111: Reserved #CXSA/CXLSA aggregated SA selection function 4'b1000: 3-SN mode (arithmetic modulo) 4'b1001: 6-SN mode (arithmetic modulo) Others:  Reserved
F 32 4 htg0_sa_device_interleave_cntl
DESC  This field controls the interleave size across all aggregated CXSA/CXLSA Devices This field is used for arithmetic modulo to select the address bits 4'h0: 64B  Interleaved (CXSA), [51:6]  - arithmetic modulo 4'h1: 128B Interleaved (CXSA), [51:7]  - arithmetic modulo 4'h2: 256B Interleaved (CXSA), [51:8]  - arithmetic modulo 4'h3: 512B Interleaved (CXSA), [51:9]  - arithmetic modulo 4'h4: 1KB  Interleaved (CXSA), [51:10] - arithmetic modulo 4'h5: 2KB  Interleaved (CXSA), [51:11] - arithmetic modulo 4'h6: 4KB  Interleaved (CXSA), [51:12] - arithmetic modulo 4'h7: 8KB  Interleaved (CXSA), [51:13] - arithmetic modulo 4'h8: 16KB Interleaved (CXSA), [51:14] - arithmetic modulo 4'h9: Reserved         (CXSA), [51:15] - arithmetic modulo Others: Reserved
F 40 3 htg0_sa_ports_cnt
DESC Specifies the number of CXSA/CXLSA device aggregated 3'b000: 1 port 3'b001: 2 ports 3'b010: 4 ports 3'b011: 8 ports 3'b100: 16 ports 3'b101: 3 ports 3'b110: 6 ports 3'b111: 12 ports
F 44 3 htg0_hash_addr_bits_sel
DESC SN hash address select(Valid for 3SN, 5SN, 6SN) 3'b000: [16:8]  address bits (Default) 3'b001: [17:9]  address bits 3'b010: [18:10] address bits 3'b011: [19:11] address bits 3'b100: [20:12] address bits 3'b101: [21:13] address bits 3'b110: [22:14] address bits 3'b111: [23:15] address bits Others: Reserved
