DESC 0: HN-F has no defined bits in [63:32] 1: HN-F has bits defined in [63:32]
F 29 1 hns_ns_mpam_has_impl_idr
DESC 0: MPAM implementation specific partitioning features not supported 1: MPAM implementation specific partitioning features supported
PAR HNS_MPAM_HAS_IMPL_IDR_PARAM
F 30 1 hns_ns_mpam_has_msmon
DESC 0: MPAM performance monitoring is not supported 1: MPAM performance monitoring is supported
PAR HNS_MPAM_HAS_MSMON_PARAM
F 31 1 hns_ns_mpam_has_partid_nrw
