F 0 16 hns_rt_mpam_partid_max
DESC Maximum value of root PARTID supported by this HN-F
PAR HNS_MPAM_RT_PARTID_PARAM
F 16 8 hns_rt_mpam_pmg_max
DESC Maximum value of root PMG supported by this HN-F
PAR HNS_MPAM_RT_PMG_PARAM
