DESC 0: MPAM performance monitoring is not supported 1: MPAM performance monitoring is supported
PAR HNS_MPAM_HAS_MSMON_PARAM
F 31 1 hns_rt_mpam_has_partid_nrw
DESC 0: HN-F does not support MPAM PARTID Narrowing 1: HN-F supports MPAM PARTID Narrowing
PAR HNS_MPAM_HAS_PARTID_NRW_PARAM
F 32 1 hns_rt_mpam_has_ris
DESC 0: HN-F does not support MPAM resource instance selector 1: HN-F supports MPAM resource instance selector
F 38 1 hns_rt_mpam_has_extd_esr
DESC 0: MPAMF_ESR is 32 bits 1: MPAMF_ESR is 64 bits
F 39 1 hns_rt_mpam_has_esr
DESC 0: HN-F does not support MPAM error handling 1: HN-F supports MPAM error handling
F 40 1 hns_rt_mpam_has_err_msi
DESC 0: HN-F does not support MSI writes to signal MPAM error interrupt 1: HN-F supports MSI writes to signal MPAM error interrupt
F 41 1 hns_rt_mpam_sp4
DESC 0: HN-F supports two PARTID spaces 1: HN-F supports four PARTID spaces
F 42 1 hns_rt_mpam_has_endis
DESC 0: HN-F does not support PARTID enable and disable functionality 1: HN-F supports PARTID enable and disable functionality
F 43 1 hns_rt_mpam_has_nfu
DESC 0: HN-F does not support no future use field 1: HN-F supports no future use field
R 0x8018 64 RO - cmn_hns_rt_mpam_iidr
RESET 0x43b 0xffffffff
DESC MPAM Implementation ID register. This is a shared register for S and NS
F 0 12 hns_rt_mpam_iidr_implementer
DESC Implementation defined value identifying company that implemented MPAM memory system component
F 12 4 hns_rt_mpam_iidr_revision
DESC Implementation defined value identifying minor revision of the product
PAR (POR_PERIPH_ID_2_PARAM / 16)
F 16 4 hns_rt_mpam_iidr_variant
DESC Implementation defined value identifying major revision of the product
PAR (POR_PERIPH_ID_2_PARAM % 16)
F 20 12 hns_rt_mpam_iidr_productid
DESC Implementation defined value identifying MPAM memory system component
PAR POR_PERIPH_ID_0_PARAM
R 0x8020 64 RO - cmn_hns_rt_mpam_aidr
RESET 0x11 0xff
DESC MPAM architecture ID register. This is a shared register for S and NS
F 0 4 hns_rt_mpam_aidr_arch_minor_rev
