F 4 4 hns_rt_mpam_aidr_arch_major_rev
DESC Major revision of the MPAM architecture that this memory system component implements
R 0x8028 64 RO ROOT cmn_hns_rt_mpam_impl_idr
RESET 0x0 0xffffffff
DESC MPAM Implementation defined partitioning feature ID register. This is banked separately
F 0 32 hns_rt_mpam_impl_idr
DESC Implementation defined partitioning features.
R 0x8030 64 RO ROOT cmn_hns_rt_mpam_cpor_idr
RESET 0x10 0xffff
