F 24 1 lnk2_req_rsvdc_ovrd_en NV
DESC When set, overrides CHI REQ RSVDC field with req rsvdc strap input for incoming requests on CCIX Link 2. Note: This field is applicable only when SMP Mode enable bit is clear (i.e. Non-SMP mode) 
F 25 1 lnk2_dat_rsvdc_ovrd_en NV
DESC When set, overrides CHI DAT RSVDC field with dat rsvdc strap input for incoming data on CCIX Link 2. Note: This field is applicable only when SMP Mode enable bit is clear (i.e. Non-SMP mode) 
F 32 10 lnk2_num_reqcrds_fixed_count NV
DESC Controls the number of CCIX request credits assigned to Link 2 If this field along with link0, link1 fixed credit count is zero then the harware uses lnk2_num_reqcrds field to assign percentage based credits. lnk0+lnk1+lnk2 num_reqcrds_fixed_count should not exceed req_pass_buff_depth field which is in por_ccg_ha_unit_info2. if the sum exceeds req_pass_buff_depth then it will cause fatal errors
F 42 10 lnk2_num_datcrds_fixed_count NV
