F 16 6 htg_region1_hier_hash_nodes
DESC Hierarchical hashing mode, define number of nodes in each cluster
F 8 6 htg_region1_hier_hash_clusters
DESC Hierarchical hashing mode, define number of clusters groups
F 3 3 htg_region1_hier_enable_address_striping
DESC Hierarchical hashing: configure number of address bits needs to shuttered (removed) at second hierarchy hash (LSB bit is based on cluster mask). 3'b000: no address shuttering 3'b001: one addr bit shuttered   (2  clusters) 3'b010: two addr bit shuttered   (4  clusters) 3'b011: three addr bit shuttered (8  clusters) 3'b100: four addr bit shuttered  (16 clusters) 3'b101: five addr bit shuttered  (32 clusters) 3'b110: six addr bit shuttered   (These are configured when the cachelines are > 64B interleaved and clusters are enabled) 3'b111: seven addr bit shuttered others: Reserved
F 2 1 htg_region1_hierarchical_hash_en
DESC Hierarchical Hashing mode enable configure bit
F 1 1 htg_region1_nonpowerof2_hash_en
