RESET 0x0 0x1fd
DESC Root register access override.
F 0 1 cfg_ctl
DESC Allows Root override of the configuration control register
F 2 1 linkid_ctl
DESC Allows Root override of the LA Link ID registers
F 3 1 portid_ctl
DESC Allows Root override of the LA Port ID registers
F 4 1 cxllink_ctl
DESC Allows Root override of the CXL link layer registers
F 5 1 ull_ctl
DESC Allows Root override of the upper link layer control registers
