DESC CCIX Error AgentID
R 0xd30 64 - ROOT por_ccla_agentid_to_portid_reg0
RESET 0x0 0x3f3f3f3f3f3f3f3f
DESC Specifies the mapping of Agent ID to Port ID for Agent IDs 0 to 7.
RGO por_ccla_rcr.portid_ctl
SGO por_ccla_scr.portid_ctl
F 0 6 agent0_portid
DESC Specifies the Port ID for Agent ID 0
