F 16 4 dcd_region_lu_start_bit_0
DESC Corresponds to DPA address bit where address to look-up in LUT starts for Region 0 4'b0000: DPA bit 26, corresponds to  64MB chunk size for region 4'b0001: DPA bit 27, corresponds to 128MB chunk size for region 4'b0010: DPA bit 28, corresponds to 256MB chunk size for region 4'b0011: DPA bit 29, corresponds to 512MB chunk size for region 4'b0100: DPA bit 30, corresponds to   1GB chunk size for region 4'b0101: DPA bit 31, corresponds to   2GB chunk size for region 4'b0110: DPA bit 32, corresponds to   4GB chunk size for region 4'b0111: DPA bit 33, corresponds to   8GB chunk size for region
All other values reserved 
F 20 4 dcd_region_lu_num_bits_0
