F 4 4 protocol
DESC Linked to the Protocol property. 
F 8 4 version
DESC 0b0000                A Others                 Reserved
F 12 4 container_format
DESC Container format supported by the interface in both directions: Bit 0 FormatX 0 Not supported 1 Supported Bit 1 FormatY 0 Not supported 1 Supported Bits 2 & 3    Reserved
F 16 4 deactivation_support
DESC Deactivation modes supported by the interface: Bit 0      Protocol Agnostic 0      Not supported 1      Supported Bit 1      Protocol Aware 0      Not supported 1      Supported
F 20 2 ide_support
DESC IDE support bits
