PAR CXLA_PORTFWD_NUM_STATIC_TXBUF_PARAM
F 33 7 portfwd_dynamic_crds
DESC Number of dynamic credits granted by this CXLA port for port forwarded traffic
PAR CXLA_PORTFWD_NUM_DYNAMIC_TXBUF_PARAM
R 0x980 64 - ROOT por_cxla_secure_register_groups_override
RESET 0x0 0xd
DESC Allows non-secure access to predefined groups of secure registers.
F 0 1 cfg_ctl
DESC Allows non-secure access to secure configuration control register
