F 33 1 tgttype_2
DESC Target type for this ID Route Entry. Valid Values: 0  Target ID is a Port Aggregation Group 1 Target ID is a port
F 34 2 loglink_2
DESC The logical link for this ID Route Entry. Valid values are 0-3
F 40 8 target_2
DESC  The Target (Port or PAG) for the ID Route Entry.
F 48 1 valid_3
