F 10 2 dvmpush_support_tx
DESC Support for WritePush for DVM transactionsbytransactions by the interface as a transmitter: 0b00              False WritePush for DVM transactions is not supported. 0b01             True WritePush for DVM transactions is supported. Others           Reserved
