F 22 2 mte_support_tx
DESC Support for MTE as a transmitter: 0b00    False MTE not supported. 0b01    Reduced MTE transaction support. 0b10    Full MTE transaction support. 0b11    Reserved
F 24 2 deferrable_write_tx
