SGO por_dn_scr.vmf
F 0 1 valid_28
DESC Register valid 1'b1: Register is enabled 1'b0: Register is not enabled
F 1 16 vmid_28
DESC VMID value NOTE: The incoming request's VMID is only compared with this VMID value if the request's VMID valid bit is set. If the request's VMID is valid and the two VMIDs match, filtering is applied to the incoming request.
F 32 16 mask_28
DESC VMID mask; enables mapping of multiple VMID values to a single register NOTE: Logically, the AND operator is performed on the mask and por_dn_vmf28_ctrl.vmid. Then, the AND operator is performed on the mask and the incoming request's VMID. The two results are then compared, and filtering is applied to the incoming request if the masked VMIDs match.
