F 0 1 cplt_dist_set
DESC Completer Distance Set 1'b0 - Reserved, 1'b1 - Set Completer Distance field to cplt_dist_set_val when sending CompData
F 2 1 cplt_type_set
DESC Completer Type Set 1'b0 - Reserved, 1'b1 - Set Completer Type field to cplt_type_set_val when sending CompData
F 6 1 cplt_func_set
DESC Completer Functional Set 1'b0 - Reserved, 1'b1 - Set Completer Functional field to cplt_func_set_val when sending CompData
F 16 2 cplt_dist_set_val
DESC Completer Distance value to use when cplt_dist_set is set to 1.
F 18 3 cplt_type_set_val
DESC Completer Type value to use when cplt_type_set is set to 1. Supported values are: 3'b000 - Default Completer Type, 3'b001 - DRAM Completer Type, 3'b011 - High Bandwidth Memory (HBM) Completer Type
F 22 2 cplt_func_set_val
DESC Completer Functional value to use when cplt_func_set is set to 1. Supported values are: 2'b00 - Default/PrefetchTgt not useful, 2'b01 - PrefetchTgt useful Prefetch useful (2'b01) is only supported when cplt_type_set_val is non-zero.
