DESC Error recovery interrupt for Deferred Errors enable
R 0xe050 64 - - por_hni_errstatus_ns
RESET 0x0 0xfff0ffff
DESC Error Status Register for Non-secure
F 0 8 serr W1C
DESC Architecturally-defined primary error code 8'h00: No error 8'h01: IMPLEMENTATION DEFINED error.  Refer to por_hni_errmisc1_NS.ERRSRC for error type details.
F 8 8 ierr W1C
DESC Implementation-defined primary error code. 8'h00: No error 8'h01: Partner implementation defined error
F 20 2 uet W1C
DESC Uncorrected Error Type 2'b00: Invalid 2'b01: Uncorrected error, Unrecoverable error (UEU).
F 22 1 pn W1C
DESC Poison 1'b0: Uncorrected or Deferred error recorded because a corrupt value was detected 1'b1: Uncorrected or Deferred error recorded because a poison value was detected
F 23 1 de W1C
DESC Deferred Error 1'b0: No errors were deferred 1'b1: At least one error was not corrected and is deferred
F 24 2 ce W1C
DESC Corrected Error 2'b00: No errors were corrected
F 26 1 mv W1C
DESC Miscellaneous Register Valid 1'b0: por_hni_errmisc_NS register not valid 1'b1: por_hni_errmisc_NS register contains additional information for an error recorded by this node
F 27 1 of W1C
DESC Overflow 1'b0: Since last cleared to zero, no error syndrome has been discarded 1'b1: Since last cleared to zero, at least one error syndrome has been discarded
F 28 1 er W1C
DESC Error Reported 1'b0: No in-band error response signaled 1'b1: In-band error response was signaled to the Requester
F 29 1 ue W1C
DESC Uncorrected Error 1'b0: No uncorrected errors detected 1'b1: At least one detected error was not corrected and not deferred
F 30 1 v W1C
DESC Status Register Valid 1'b0: por_hni_errstatus_NS not valid 1'b1: por_hni_errstatus_NS valid. At least one error has been recorded
F 31 1 av W1C
DESC Address Valid 1'b0: por_hni_erraddr_NS not valid 1'b1: por_hni_erraddr_NS contains an address associated with the highest priority error recorded by this node
R 0xe058 64 - - por_hni_erraddr_ns
RESET 0x0 0xc80fffffffffffff
DESC Error Address Register for Non-secure
F 0 52 paddr
DESC Physical Address
F 59 1 nse
DESC Non-Secure Extension attribute (NSE, also PAS[1])
F 62 1 si
DESC PAS Incorrect 1'b0: PAS[1:0] is correct 1'b1: PAS[1:0] might not be correct
F 63 1 ns
DESC Non-Secure attribute (NS, also PAS[0])
R 0xe068 64 - - por_hni_errmisc1_ns
RESET 0x0 0x1f300007f7f7fff
DESC Error Miscellaneous Register 1
F 0 4 errsrc
DESC Error source 4'b0000: Coherent read 4'b0001: Coherent write 4'b0010: Coherent dataless (CleanUnique/MakeUnique/Evict/StashOnce/CMO) 4'b0011: Atomic 4'b0100: Illegal configuration read 4'b0101: Illegal configuration write or dataless 4'b0110: Configuration write data partial byte enable error 4'b0111: Configuration write data parity error or poison error 4'b1000: BRESP error 4'b1001: Poison error 4'b1010: BRESP error and poison error 4'b1011: Unsupported Exclusive access (HN-P only) NOTE: BRESP and poison errors (0x8-0xA) are Uncorrectable Errors (UE). SRCID and ERRSRC are the only valid fields in por_hni_errmisc1_NS. All other error types are Deferred Errors (DE) and all fields are valid.
F 4 11 srcid
DESC CHI Source ID field
F 16 7 opcode
DESC CHI Opcode field
F 24 4 memattr
DESC CHI Memory Attributes field
F 28 3 size
DESC CHI Size field
F 48 2 order
DESC CHI Order field
F 52 5 lpid
DESC CHI Logic Processor ID (LPID) field
R 0xe800 64 RO ROOT por_hni_errpfgf
RESET 0x30001e25 0x30001ee5
DESC Pseudo-fault Generation Feature Register for Root
RGO por_hni_rcr.ras
SGO por_hni_scr.ras
F 29 1 syn
DESC Fault syndrome injection 1'b1: Fault injection does not update por_hni_errstatus.SERR
F 28 1 na
DESC No access required 1'b1: The component fakes detection of the error spontaneously in the fault injection state
F 12 1 mv
DESC Miscellaneous syndrome 1'b1: The node does not update any fields in por_hni_errmisc1_NS and sets por_hni_errstatus.MV to por_hni_errpfgctl.MV
F 11 1 av
DESC Address syndrome 1'b1: The node does not update por_hni_erraddr_NS and sets por_hni_errstatus.AV to por_hni_errpfgctl.AV
F 10 1 pn
DESC Poison flag 1'b1: When an injected error is recorded, por_hni_errstatus.PN is set to por_hni_errpfgctl.PN
F 9 1 er
DESC Error reported flag 1'b1: When an injected error is recorded, por_hni_errstatus.ER is set to por_hni_errpfgctl.ER
F 6 2 ce
DESC Corrected Error generation 2'b00: The fault generation feature of the node cannot generate this type of error
F 5 1 de
DESC Deferred Error generation 1'b1: The fault generation feature of the node allows generation of this type of error
F 2 1 ueu
DESC Unrecoverable Error generation 1'b1: The fault generation feature of the node allows generation of this type of error
F 0 1 of
DESC Overflow flag 1'b1: When an injected error is recorded, por_hni_errstatus.OF is set to por_hni_errpfgctl.OF
R 0xe808 64 - ROOT por_hni_errpfgctl
RESET 0x0 0x80001ee5
DESC Pseudo-fault Generation Control Register for Root
RGO por_hni_rcr.ras
SGO por_hni_scr.ras
F 31 1 cdnen
DESC Countdown Enable 1'b0: The Error Generation Counter is disabled 1'b1: The Error Generation Counter is enabled
F 12 1 mv
DESC Miscellaneous syndrome 1'b0: por_hni_errstatus.MV is set to 1'b0 when an injected error is recorded 1'b1: por_hni_errstatus.MV is set to 1'b1 when an injected error is recorded
F 11 1 av
DESC Address syndrome 1'b0: por_hni_ERRSTATUS.AV is set to 1'b0 when an injected error is recorded 1'b1: por_hni_ERRSTATUS.AV is set to 1'b1 when an injected error is recorded
F 10 1 pn
DESC Poison flag 1'b0: por_hni_errstatus.PN is set to 1'b0 when an injected error is recorded 1'b1: por_hni_errstatus.PN is set to 1'b1 when an injected error is recorded
F 9 1 er
DESC Error Reported flag 1'b0:  por_hni_errstatus.ER is set to 1'b0 when an injected error is recorded 1'b1:  por_hni_errstatus.ER is set to 1'b1 when an injected error is recorded
F 6 2 ce
DESC Corrected Error generation enable 2'b00: No error of this type will be generated
F 5 1 de
DESC Deferred Error generation enable 1'b0: No error of this type will be generated 1'b1: An error of this type might be generated when the Error Generation Counter decrements to zero
F 2 1 ueu
DESC Unrecoverable Error generation enable 1'b0: No error of this type will be generated 1'b1: An error of this type might be generated when the Error Generation Counter decrements to zero
F 0 1 of
DESC Overflow flag 1'b0: por_hni_errstatus.OF is set to 1'b0 when an injected error is recorded 1'b1: por_hni_errstatus.OF is set to 1'b1 when an injected error is recorded
R 0xe810 64 - ROOT por_hni_errpfgcdn
RESET 0x0 0xffffffff
DESC Pseudo-fault Generation Countdown Register for Root
RGO por_hni_rcr.ras
SGO por_hni_scr.ras
F 0 32 cdn
DESC Countdown value
