DESC Connected device type 6'b000000: Reserved 6'b000001: RN-I 6'b000010: RN-D 6'b000011: Reserved 6'b000100: RN-F_CHIB 6'b000101: RN-F_CHIB_ESAM 6'b000110: RN-F_CHIA 6'b000111: RN-F_CHIA_ESAM 6'b001000: HN-T 6'b001001: HN-I 6'b001010: HN-D 6'b001011: HN-P 6'b001100: SN-F_CHIC 6'b001101: SBSX 6'b001110: HN-F 6'b001111: SN-F_CHIE 6'b010000: SN-F_CHID 6'b010001: CXHA 6'b010010: CXRA 6'b010011: CXRH 6'b010100: RN-F_CHID 6'b010101: RN-F_CHID_ESAM 6'b010110: RN-F_CHIC 6'b010111: RN-F_CHIC_ESAM 6'b011000: RN-F_CHIE 6'b011001: RN-F_CHIE_ESAM 6'b011010: Reserved 6'b011011: Reserved 6'b011100: MTSX 6'b011101: HN-V 6'b011110: CCG 6'b100000: RN-F_CHIF 6'b100001: RN-F_CHIF_ESAM 6'b100010: SN-F_CHIF 6'b100011-6'111111: Reserved
PAR MXP_DEV_TYPE_P5_D0_PARAM
F 7 1 cal_connected_p5
DESC When set, CAL is connected on port 5 (Allowed values: 0-1)
PAR (MXP_NUM_DEV_P5_PARAM > 1) ? 1'b1 : 1'b0
F 8 4 num_ccs_p5
DESC Number of CAL credited slices connected to port 5 (Allowed values: 0-2)
PAR MXP_NUM_CCS_CONNECTED_P5_PARAM
F 16 4 num_dcs_p5_d0
DESC Number of device credited slices connected to port 5 device 0 (Allowed values: 0-4)
PAR MXP_NUM_DCS_CONNECTED_P5_D0_PARAM
F 20 4 num_dcs_p5_d1
DESC Number of device credited slices connected to port 5 device 1 (Allowed values: 0-4)
PAR MXP_NUM_DCS_CONNECTED_P5_D1_PARAM
F 24 4 num_dcs_p5_d2
DESC Number of device credited slices connected to port 5 device 2 (Allowed values: 0-4)
PAR MXP_NUM_DCS_CONNECTED_P5_D2_PARAM
F 28 4 num_dcs_p5_d3
DESC Number of device credited slices connected to port 5 device 3 (Allowed values: 0-4)
PAR MXP_NUM_DCS_CONNECTED_P5_D3_PARAM
