R 0x980 64 - S por_mxp_scr
RESET 0x0 0x1ff
DESC Secure register access override.
F 0 1 qos
DESC Allows Secure override of the QoS registers
F 1 1 syscoreq_ctl
DESC Allows Secure override of the syscoreq_ctl registers
F 2 1 mpam_ctrl
DESC Allows Secure override of the CHI port MPAM override registers
F 3 1 multi_mesh_ctl
DESC Allows Secure override of the Multi Mesh control registers
F 4 1 xy_override_ctl
DESC Allows Secure override of the XY override registers
F 5 1 ldid_override_ctl
DESC Allows Secure override of the LDID override registers
F 6 1 pa2setaddr_ctl
DESC Allows Secure override of the PA to SETADDR control registers
F 7 1 ras_secure_access_override
DESC Allow Secure override of the to RAS registers
F 8 1 cfg_ctl
DESC Allows Secure override of the configuration control register
R 0x988 64 - ROOT por_mxp_rcr
RESET 0x0 0x1ff
DESC Root register access override.
