F 7 1 ras_secure_access_override
DESC Allows Root override of the RAS registers
F 8 1 cfg_ctl
DESC Allows Root override of the configuration control register
R 0xa00 64 - ROOT por_mxp_aux_ctl
RESET 0x0 0x1
DESC Functions as the auxiliary control register for XP.
F 0 1 clkgate_disable
DESC Disables clock gating when set
