R 0xa10 64 - ROOT por_mxp_p0_mpam_override
RESET 0x0 0x10fff31
DESC Controls MPAM fields for devices connected to port 0. Valid only if the devices doesn't support MPAM.
RGO por_mxp_rcr.mpam_ctrl
SGO por_mxp_scr.mpam_ctrl
F 0 1 p0_req_mpam_override_enable
DESC P0 DEV MPAM Override Enable on REQ Channel: 1 - Drive the MPAM fields on REQ channel with the values from this register, 0 - Override of MPAM fields in REQ channel is disabled
F 4 1 p0_req_mpam_ns
DESC MPAM.NS sub-field that overrides the REQ channel MPAM.NS when p0_req_mpam_override_enable is set
F 5 1 p0_req_mpam_nse
DESC MPAM.NSE sub-field that overrides the REQ channel MPAM.NSE when p0_req_mpam_override_enable is set
