DESC Port 0 QoS scale factor 3'b000: 2^(-3) 3'b001: 2^(-4) 3'b010: 2^(-5) 3'b011: 2^(-6) 3'b100: 2^(-7) 3'b101: 2^(-8) 3'b110: 2^(-9) 3'b111: 2^(-10)
