SGO por_mxp_scr.qos
F 0 1 p5_lat_en
DESC Enables port 5 QoS regulation when set
F 2 1 p5_qos_override_en
DESC Enables port 5 QoS override; when set, allows QoS value on inbound transactions to be overridden
F 4 1 p5_reg_mode
DESC Configures the QoS regulator mode 1'b0: Latency mode 1'b1: Period mode; used for bandwidth regulation
F 6 1 p5_pqv_mode
DESC Configures the QoS regulator mode during period mode 1'b0: Normal mode; QoS value is stable when the manager is idle 1'b1: Quiesce high mode; QoS value tends to the maximum value when the manager is idle
