F 44 3 setaddr_indx_9_shutter_sf_p7
DESC Program to specify address bit shuttering for setaddr index 9 from the setaddr_startbit_sf 3'b000 : pass-through 3'b001 : shift_1 3'b010 : shift_2 3'b011 : shift_3 3'b100 : shift_4 3'b101 : shift_5
F 48 3 setaddr_indx_10_shutter_sf_p7
