R 0xe00 64 - ROOT por_mxp_p0_datasource_ctl
RESET 0x3410000234000045 0x3cdf00473cdf0047
DESC Functions as the DataSource control register to determine how to drive the CHI DAT.DataSource field. Valid only for Legacy CHI RNF and SNF devices.
RGO por_mxp_rcr.cfg_ctl
SGO por_mxp_scr.cfg_ctl
F 0 1 cplt_dist_set_upload_p0
DESC Completer Distance Set 1'b0 - Reserved 1'b1 - Set Completer Distance field to cplt_dist_set_val
F 1 1 cplt_dist_incr_upload_p0
DESC Completer Distance Increment 1'b0 - Completer Distance Increment override is not supported for an upload 1'b1 - Reserved This field is NOT used for an upload from either an SNF or an RNF device.
F 2 1 cplt_type_set_upload_p0
DESC Completer Type Set 1'b0 - Reserved 1'b1 - Set Completer Type field to cplt_type_set_val
F 6 1 cplt_func_set_upload_p0
DESC Completer Functional Set 1'b0 - Use the unused prefetch info for cache groups (applicable only for RNF device type) 1'b0 - Use the memory prefetch useful/not useful info (applicable only for SNF device type) 1'b1 - Set Completer Functional field to cplt_func_set_val
F 16 2 cplt_dist_set_val_upload_p0
DESC Completer Distance value to use when cplt_dist_set is set to 1.
F 18 3 cplt_type_set_val_upload_p0
DESC Completer Type value to use when cplt_type_set is set to 1. Supported values are: 3'b000 - Default Completer Type 3'b001 - DRAM Completer Type 3'b011 - High Bandwidth Memory (HBM) Completer Type 3'b100 - Cache Snoop Hit (applicable only for RNF device type) 3'b101 - Interconnect Cache (applicable only for RNF device type) 3'b110 - Cache Group 2 (applicable only for RNF device type)
PAR (  (MXP_DEV_TYPE_P0_D0_PARAM == POR_DEV_SNF_PARAM)  || (MXP_DEV_TYPE_P0_D0_PARAM == POR_DEV_SNFD_PARAM) || (MXP_DEV_TYPE_P0_D0_PARAM == POR_DEV_SNFE_PARAM) || (MXP_DEV_TYPE_P0_D0_PARAM == POR_DEV_SNFF_PARAM)) ? 3'b001 : 3'b100
F 22 2 cplt_func_set_val_upload_p0
DESC Completer Functional value to use when cplt_func_set is set to 1. Supported values for memory group completer type (applicable only for SNF device type) are: 2'b00 - Memory PrefetchTgt not useful 2'b01 - Memory PrefetchTgt useful Supported values for cachegroup completer type (applicable only for RNF device type) are: 2'b00 - Cache group 2'b01 - Cache group unused prefetch Memory PrefetchTgt useful or cache group unused prefetch (2'b01) are only supported when cplt_type_set_val is non-zero. For default completer type, functional should always be 00.
PAR (  (MXP_DEV_TYPE_P0_D0_PARAM == POR_DEV_SNF_PARAM)  || (MXP_DEV_TYPE_P0_D0_PARAM == POR_DEV_SNFD_PARAM) || (MXP_DEV_TYPE_P0_D0_PARAM == POR_DEV_SNFE_PARAM) || (MXP_DEV_TYPE_P0_D0_PARAM == POR_DEV_SNFF_PARAM)) ? 2'b01 : 2'b00
F 26 2 cplt_dist_incr_val_upload_p0
DESC Completer Increment value to use when cplt_dist_incr is set to 1. This field is NOT used for an upload from either an SNF or an RNF device.
F 28 2 cplt_dist_incr_limit_upload_p0
DESC Completer Increment limit to use when cplt_dist_incr is set to 1 and Completer Distance is incremented. This field is NOT used for an upload from either an SNF or an RNF device.
F 32 1 cplt_dist_set_download_p0
DESC Completer Distance Set 1'b0 - Completer Distance Set override is not supported for a download 1'b1 - Reserved This field is NOT used for a download on an RNF device and datasource mapping for download on an SNF device is not supported.
F 33 1 cplt_dist_incr_download_p0
DESC Completer Distance Increment 1'b0 - Use the incoming datasource value from the CHIG mesh to do the direct mapping conversion 1'b1 - Increment Completer Distance by programmed cplt_dist_incrvalue upto cplt_dist_incrlimit to override the incoming datasource value from the CHIG mesh to do the direct mapping conversion This field is ONLY used for a download on an RNF device and datasource mapping for download on an SNF device is not supported.
F 34 1 cplt_type_set_download_p0
DESC Completer Type Set 1'b0 - Completer Type Set override is not supported for a download 1'b1 - Reserved This field is NOT used for a download on an RNF device and datasource mapping for download on an SNF device is not supported.
F 38 1 cplt_func_set_download_p0
DESC Completer Functional Set 1'b0 - Functional Set override is not supported for a download 1'b1 - Reserved This field is NOT used for a download on an RNF device and datasource mapping for download on an SNF device is not supported.
F 48 2 cplt_dist_set_val_download_p0
DESC Completer Distance value to use when cplt_dist_set is set to 1. This field is NOT used for a download on an RNF device and datasource mapping for download on an SNF device is not supported.
F 50 3 cplt_type_set_val_download_p0
DESC Completer Type value to use when cplt_type_set is set to 1. This field is NOT used for a download on an RNF device and datasource mapping for download on an SNF device is not supported.
F 54 2 cplt_func_set_val_download_p0
DESC Functional value to use when func_set is set to 1. This field is NOT used for a download on an RNF device and datasource mapping for download on an SNF device is not supported.
F 58 2 cplt_dist_incr_val_download_p0
DESC Completer Increment value to use when cplt_dist_incr is set to 1. This field is ONLY used for a download on an RNF device and datasource mapping for download on an SNF device is not supported.
F 60 2 cplt_dist_incr_limit_download_p0
DESC Completer Increment limit to use when cplt_dist_incr is set to 1 and Completer Distance is incremented. This field is ONLY used for a download on an RNF device and datasource mapping for download on an SNF device is not supported.
