F 10 1 snp_vc3_xy_override
DESC Override XY routing for SNP channel VC 3
F 11 1 dat_vc3_xy_override
DESC Override XY routing for DAT channel VC 3
F 12 1 req_vc4_xy_override
DESC Override XY routing for REQ channel VC 4
