R 0xa1a0 64 - - por_dtm_wp0_config
RESET 0x0 0x1fffff
DESC Configures watchpoint 0.
F 0 1 wp_dev_sel
DESC Device port selection in specified SMXP 1'b0: Select device port 0 1'b1: Select device port 1
F 1 3 wp_chn_sel
DESC VC selection 3'b000: Select REQ VC 3'b001: Select RSP VC 3'b010: Select SNP VC 3'b011: Select DATA VC NOTE: All other values are reserved.
F 4 2 wp_grp
DESC Watchpoint register format group 2'h0: Select primary group 2'h1: Select secondary group 2'h2: Select tertiary group 2'h3: Reserved
F 6 2 rsvdc_bsel
DESC Byte select of RSVDC in trace packet 2'h0: Select RSVDC[7:0] 2'h1: Select RSVDC[15:8] 2'h2: Select RSVDC[23:16] 2'h3: Select RSVDC[31:24]
F 8 1 wp_exclusive
DESC Watchpoint mode 1'b0: Regular mode 1'b1: Exclusive mode
F 9 1 wp_combine
DESC Enables combination of watchpoints 0 and 1
F 10 1 wp_pkt_gen
DESC Enables watchpoint trace packet generation
F 11 3 wp_pkt_type
DESC Trace packet type 3'b000: TXNID (up to X18) 3'b001: TXNID + opcode (up to X9) 3'b010: TXNID + opcode + source ID + target ID (up to X4) 3'b011: Reserved 3'b100: Control flit 3'b101: DAT flit DATA [127:0] 3'b110: DAT flit DATA [255:128] 3'b111: Reserved
F 14 1 wp_cc_en
DESC Enables inclusion of cycle count in watchpoint track packet generation
F 15 1 wp_ctrig_en
DESC Enables watchpoint cross trigger packet generation
F 16 1 wp_dbgtrig_en
DESC Enables watchpoint debug trigger packet generation
F 17 2 wp_dev_sel2
DESC Upper bits for device port selection in specified SMXP
F 19 2 wp_chn_num
DESC VC number index for replicated channels in specified SMXP
R 0xa1a8 64 - - por_dtm_wp0_val
RESET 0x0 0xffffffffffffffff
DESC Configures watchpoint 0 comparison value.
F 0 64 val
DESC Refer to DTM watchpoint section for details
R 0xa1b0 64 - - por_dtm_wp0_mask
RESET 0x0 0xffffffffffffffff
DESC Configures watchpoint 0 comparison mask.
F 0 64 mask
DESC Refer to DTM watchpoint section for details
