DESC Functions as the DTM control register. //NOTE: There will be max. of 3 DTM registers based on MXP_MULTIPLE_DTM_EN_PARAM and MXP_NUM_DEV_PORT_PARAM value. Each successive DTM register will be at the next 'h200 + 8 byte address boundary. Each successive DTM register will be named with the suffix corresponding to the DT register number. For example por_dtm_control_dt<0:3> 
F 0 1 dtm_enable
DESC Enables debug watchpoint and PMU function; prior to writing this bit, all other DT configuration registers must be programmed; once this bit is set, other DT configuration registers must not be modified
