RESET 0x0 0x50d
DESC Functions as the non-secure error control register. Controls whether specific error-handling interrupts and error detection/deferment are enabled.
F 0 1 ed
DESC Enables error detection as specified in por_mxp_errfr_NS.ED
F 2 1 ui
DESC Enables error recovery interrupt for uncorrected error as specified in por_mxp_errfr_NS.UI
F 3 1 fi
DESC Enables fault handling interrupt for uncorrected and deferred errors as specified in por_mxp_errfr_NS.FI
F 8 1 cfi
DESC Enables fault handling interrupt for corrected error as specified in por_mxp_errfr_NS.CFI
