F 28 1 s2_sends_ar_unq_id
DESC If set, indicates AR transactions on Port2 are always Unique ID. This bit for a port must be set to 1 to enable Read Burst on the CHI side of RND.
F 29 1 s2_tablewalk_mstr_present
DESC Must be set if translation table walk manager present such as TCU or GIC. This affects RND AR channel only.
