DESC Indicates node type 3'b000: HN-F 3'b001: HN-I 3'b010: CXRA 3'b011: HN-P 3'b100: PCI-CXRA 3'b101: HN-S Others: Reserved
F 0 1 htg_scndry_region6_valid
DESC Secondary memory region 6 valid 1'b0: Not valid 1'b1: Valid for memory region comparison
R 0xe78 64 - ROOT hashed_target_grp_secondary_cfg1_reg7
RESET 0x0 0x7f0fffffffff7ffd
DESC Configures secondary hashed memory regions
RGO por_rnsam_rcr.mem_range
SGO por_rnsam_scr.mem_range
F 56 7 htg_scndry_region7_size
DESC Secondary memory region 7 size CONSTRAINT: Memory region must be a power of two, from minimum size supported to maximum memory size (2^address width).
F 16 36 htg_scndry_region7_base_addr
DESC Bits [51:16] of base address of the range, LSB bit is defined by the parameter POR_RNSAM_HTG_RCOMP_LSB_PARAM
F 5 10 htg_region7_cacheid
DESC Specifies the coherency domain associated to the HTG7
F 2 3 htg_scndry_region7_target_type
DESC Indicates node type 3'b000: HN-F 3'b001: HN-I 3'b010: CXRA 3'b011: HN-P 3'b100: PCI-CXRA 3'b101: HN-S Others: Reserved
