F 56 7 size
DESC Memory region size CONSTRAINT: Memory region must be a power of two, from minimum size supported to maximum memory size (2^address width).
F 4 4 qos
DESC Indicates the QoS value to be used for this region
F 2 1 sn_tgtid_override
DESC Override the SN targetId for address contained in the region of this register
F 1 1 qos_override
DESC QoS Memory region allow override 1'b0: Do not override the QoS value from the QoS regulator 1'b1: Override the QoS value with the programmed value in regionX_qos
