DESC Hierarchical hashing: Enable cluster masking to achieve different interleave granularity across clusters. 4'b0000: 64   byte interleave granularity across clusters 4'b0110: 4096 byte interleave granularity across clusters 4'b1111: Cluster interleaving disabled others: Reserved
