RESET 0x4 0x7f0fffffffff00f7
DESC Configures the prefetch nonhash memory region 0
RGO por_rnsam_rcr.mem_range
SGO por_rnsam_scr.mem_range
F 16 36 scg0_prefetch_nonhash_reg0_base_addr
DESC Bits [51:16] of base address of the range, LSB bit is defined by the parameter POR_HNSAM_RCOMP_LSB_PARAM
F 56 7 scg0_prefetch_nonhash_reg0_size
DESC Memory region size CONSTRAINT: Memory region must be a power of two, from minimum size supported to maximum memory size (2^address width).
F 4 4 scg0_prefetch_nonhash_reg0_qos_value
DESC Indicates the QoS value to be used for this region
F 2 1 scg0_prefetch_nonhash_reg0_prefetch_enable
DESC Enables the prefetch non-hashed logic (added to enable QOS override only functionality) 1'b0: Disables the prefetch functionality ( programmed if only QOS override functionality is intended) 1'b1: Enables  the prefetch functionality ( Enabled by default)
F 1 1 scg0_prefetch_nonhash_reg0_qos_override_enable
DESC Prefetch nonhash allow QOS override 1'b0: Do not override the QoS value from the QoS regulator 1'b1: Override the QoS value with the programmed value in regionX_qos
F 0 1 scg0_prefetch_nonhash_reg0_region_valid
DESC Prefetch Nonhash region valid 1'b0: Not valid 1'b1: Valid for memory region comparison
